###############################################################
# 7. STOP - and confirm it stopped cleanly, not by being killed
###############################################################

---------------------------------------------------------------
$ docker stop attendance-app
---------------------------------------------------------------
attendance-app

  docker stop took 0 s. The default kill timeout is 10 s,
  so a clean shutdown is anything well under it - which is what the
  exec form of ENTRYPOINT buys: the JVM is PID 1 and gets SIGTERM.

---------------------------------------------------------------
$ docker ps -a --filter name=attendance-app --format 'table {{.Names}}\t{{.Status}}'
